65
00:03:38,960 --> 00:03:41,640
And if you take a chili pepper, like this habanero,

66
00:03:41,740 --> 00:03:45,280
and slice it lengthwise so that you can see the inside of it,

67
00:03:45,281 --> 00:03:49,280
the capsaicin is located only on the vein of the chili,

68
00:03:49,380 --> 00:03:50,960
