00:19:55,021 --> 00:19:57,660
Now, the reason these butchiloquia peppers are so hot

365
00:19:57,760 --> 00:20:00,720
is because the capsaicin is on the entire placenta,

366
00:20:00,820 --> 00:20:02,660
or the vein, whereas in the habanero,

367
00:20:02,760 --> 00:20:03,860
it was only in the glands.

368
00:20:03,960 --> 00:20:08,960
But on here, they're so hot because it covers the entire vein.

